OL,3,ANew Yorkers were 'lied' to about toxic
OL,4,Aair after 9/11 attacks, says Mamdani
OL,5,
OL,6,FToxic air quality was recorded in
OL,7,FManhattan soon after the 9/11 attacks
OL,8,Feven as officials played down health
OL,9,Frisks to the public, according to a
OL,10,Ftrove of newly released files.
OL,12,FAsbestos was found "nearly everywhere"
OL,13,Fthey tested near Ground Zero, where the
OL,14,FWorld Trade Center towers collapsed in
OL,15,F2001, New York City Mayor Zohran
OL,16,FMamdani said on Tuesday.
OL,18,F"People got sick because the leaders
OL,19,Fthey trusted lied and told them they
OL,20,Fwere safe to breathe in toxic air," he
OL,21,Fsaid, announcing the release of 170,000
OL,22,Fdocuments related to the attacks.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
