OL,3,ANew Yorkers were 'lied' to about toxic
OL,4,Aair after 9/11 attacks, says Mamdani
OL,5,
OL,6,FIllnesses related to the dust and smoke
OL,7,Ffrom the collapse of the Twin Towers
OL,8,Fhave claimed more lives than the
OL,9,Fattacks themselves, US health officials
OL,10,Fsay.
